	<div class="_idGenObjectStyleOverride-1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;border-width:0pt;">
		<p class="ParaOverride-14" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:72pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><span class="CharOverride-4" style="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(vii)<span style="width: 23px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>adopt, modify, amend, enter into and/or terminate any material Plan or any material benefit or compensation plan, policy, program or agreement that would be a Plan if in effect as of the date of this Agreement, except as may be required by applicable Law, is necessary in order to consummate the Transactions, is deemed by the Company to be in the best interest of the Company or any Company Subsidiary, or for health and welfare plan renewals in the ordinary course of business;</span></p>
