		<p class="ParaOverride-13" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:72pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><span class="CharOverride-4" style="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(c)<span style="width: 30px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>Nothing herein shall require the Company to obtain consent from Parent to do any of the foregoing if obtaining such consent would be expected to violate applicable Law, and nothing contained in this </span><span class="CharOverride-5" style="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;">Section&#160;6.01</span><span class="CharOverride-4" style="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shall give to Parent, directly or indirectly, the right to control or direct the ordinary course of business operations of the Company or any of the Company Subsidiaries prior to the Closing Date.</span></p>
