-weight:bold;">First Merger</span><span class="CharOverride-2" style="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#8221;), with the Target surviving the First Merger as a wholly owned subsidiary of the Company, and, second, the Target merged with and into Merger Sub II (the &#8220;</span><span class="CharOverride-3" style="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Second Merger</span><span class="CharOverride-2" style="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#8221;), with Merger Sub II surviving the Second Merger as a wholly owned subsidiary of the Company.</span></p>
