		<p class="ParaOverride-26" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><span class="CharOverride-2" style="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(c)&#160;&#160;This Agreement (together with the BCA and the other agreements referenced herein and therein) constitutes the entire agreement among the Parties with respect to the subject matter hereof and supersede all prior agreements and undertakings, both written and oral, among the Parties, or any of them, with respect to the subject matter hereof, except for the Confidentiality Agreement.</span></p>
